{"id":"8ee356c2b76fa7ec","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-chern-class.md","title":"Chern Class","display":"df-chern-class — Chern Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-chern-class","aliases":["58-df-chern-class"],"display":"df-chern-class — Chern Class","depends_on":["[[58-df-complex-vector-bundle]]","[[58-df-cohomology]]","[[58-df-bundle-classifying-data.md]]","[[58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md]]","[[58-df-cohomology-realization.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-chern-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-chern-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-chern-class — Chern Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97bfaddac2f220a7\" href=\"?note=97bfaddac2f220a7\" title=\"58-df-complex-vector-bundle\">58-df-complex-vector-bundle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"03f2d34d9851bee4\" href=\"?note=03f2d34d9851bee4\" title=\"58-df-cohomology\">58-df-cohomology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3f045a36dba6b5ef\" href=\"?note=3f045a36dba6b5ef\" title=\"58-df-bundle-classifying-data.md\">58-df-bundle-classifying-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e5fc9ff70d8260ec\" href=\"?note=e5fc9ff70d8260ec\" title=\"58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md\">58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"213ce75a48289483\" href=\"?note=213ce75a48289483\" title=\"58-df-cohomology-realization.md\">58-df-cohomology-realization.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,c_k,c,b,u\\in V\">\\(E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,c_k,c,b,u\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S\\)</span> 保留参数顺序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n)\">\\((E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n)\\)</span>，纤维运算使用其固定结构族。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U:\\omega\\to V\">\\(\\mathcal U:\\omega\\to V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U(n)=\\langle B_n,\\tau_{B_n},\\gamma_n,\\pi_n,\\tau_{\\gamma_n},b_n\\rangle_6\">\\(\\mathcal U(n)=\\langle B_n,\\tau_{B_n},\\gamma_n,\\pi_n,\\tau_{\\gamma_n},b_n\\rangle_6\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{UniversalComplexBundleModel}_S(B_n,\\tau_{B_n},\\gamma_n,\\pi_n,\\tau_{\\gamma_n},n,b_n)\">\\(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{UniversalComplexBundleModel}_S(B_n,\\tau_{B_n},\\gamma_n,\\pi_n,\\tau_{\\gamma_n},n,b_n)\\)</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BU(n)=B_n\">\\(BU(n)=B_n\\)</span>；该谓词和各项编码来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3f045a36dba6b5ef\" href=\"?note=3f045a36dba6b5ef\" title=\"58-df-bundle-classifying-data.md\">58-df-bundle-classifying-data.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=G_1\">\\(L=G_1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_n=L^n\">\\(P_n=L^n\\)</span> 及其拓扑、投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_{n,i}\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_{n,i}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e5fc9ff70d8260ec\" href=\"?note=e5fc9ff70d8260ec\" title=\"58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md\">58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md</a> 的显式模型；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{CP}^{\\infty}=L\">\\(\\mathbb{CP}^{\\infty}=L\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_n=b_n\\circ\\mathrm{GrassmannianSplitting}_S(n)\">\\(\\iota_n=b_n\\circ\\mathrm{GrassmannianSplitting}_S(n)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H:\\mathscr X\\to V\">\\(\\mathcal H:\\mathscr X\\to V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr X\">\\(\\mathscr X\\)</span> 是包含本文件所用全部空间对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle Y,\\tau_Y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle Y,\\tau_Y\\rangle\\)</span> 的集合，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\langle Y,\\tau_Y\\rangle\\in\\mathscr X\\;\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(\\mathcal H(\\langle Y,\\tau_Y\\rangle),Y,\\tau_Y)\">\\(\\forall\\langle Y,\\tau_Y\\rangle\\in\\mathscr X\\;\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(\\mathcal H(\\langle Y,\\tau_Y\\rangle),Y,\\tau_Y)\\)</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_Y=\\mathcal H(\\langle Y,\\tau_Y\\rangle)\">\\(D_Y=\\mathcal H(\\langle Y,\\tau_Y\\rangle)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^j(Y;\\mathbb Z)=H_{D_Y}(j)\">\\(H^j(Y;\\mathbb Z)=H_{D_Y}(j)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^*(Y;\\mathbb Z)=G_{D_Y}\">\\(H^*(Y;\\mathbb Z)=G_{D_Y}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本文件的输入满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle X,\\tau_X\\rangle\\in\\mathscr X\">\\(\\langle X,\\tau_X\\rangle\\in\\mathscr X\\)</span>；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle B_n,\\tau_{B_n}\\rangle,\\langle P_n,\\tau_{P_n}\\rangle,\\langle L,\\tau_L\\rangle\\in\\mathscr X\">\\(\\langle B_n,\\tau_{B_n}\\rangle,\\langle P_n,\\tau_{P_n}\\rangle,\\langle L,\\tau_L\\rangle\\in\\mathscr X\\)</span>。比较映射记录原先固定的上同调模型；输出类仍属于该模型的载体。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:(Y,\\tau_Y)\\to(Z,\\tau_Z)\">\\(f:(Y,\\tau_Y)\\to(Z,\\tau_Z)\\)</span> 连续，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_j^*=\\mathrm{RealizedCohomologyPullback}_S(f,D_Y,D_Z,Y,\\tau_Y,Z,\\tau_Z,j)\">\\(f_j^*=\\mathrm{RealizedCohomologyPullback}_S(f,D_Y,D_Z,Y,\\tau_Y,Z,\\tau_Z,j)\\)</span>；下式各处均明确显示次数。总类使用指定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi_{D_X}\">\\(\\Psi_{D_X}\\)</span>，不将不同次数的群元素直接相加。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassifyingMap}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassifyingMap}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 的显示元数分别保留为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"7,3,8,7\">\\(7,3,8,7\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BundlePullbackIsomorphism}\">\\(\\mathrm{BundlePullbackIsomorphism}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3f045a36dba6b5ef\" href=\"?note=3f045a36dba6b5ef\" title=\"58-df-bundle-classifying-data.md\">58-df-bundle-classifying-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealizedElementarySymmetricValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{RealizedElementarySymmetricValue}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalRealizedCohomologyValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalRealizedCohomologyValue}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"213ce75a48289483\" href=\"?note=213ce75a48289483\" title=\"58-df-cohomology-realization.md\">58-df-cohomology-realization.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TautologicalLineGenerator}\">\\(\\mathrm{TautologicalLineGenerator}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e5fc9ff70d8260ec\" href=\"?note=e5fc9ff70d8260ec\" title=\"58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md\">58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chern\\text{-}class\\text{-}classifying}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ClassifyingMap}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(b;E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Continuous}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(b;X,\\tau_X,B_n,\\tau_{B_n})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists h\\in V\\;\\mathrm{BundlePullbackIsomorphism}_S\n(h,E,\\pi,\\tau_E,\\gamma_n,\\pi_n,\\tau_{\\gamma_n},X,\\tau_X,B_n,\\tau_{B_n},b,n).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chern\\text{-}class\\text{-}classifying}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ClassifyingMap}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(b;E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Continuous}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(b;X,\\tau_X,B_n,\\tau_{B_n})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists h\\in V\\;\\mathrm{BundlePullbackIsomorphism}_S\n(h,E,\\pi,\\tau_E,\\gamma_n,\\pi_n,\\tau_{\\gamma_n},X,\\tau_X,B_n,\\tau_{B_n},b,n).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chern\\text{-}class\\text{-}universal}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{UniversalChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,k,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land k\\in n+1\\land u\\in H^{2k}(B_n;\\mathbb Z)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists a,x,v\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{TautologicalLineGenerator}_S(a,D_L)\n\\land x\\in H^2(P_n;\\mathbb Z)^n\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall i\\in n\\;x(i)=(\\operatorname{pr}_{n,i})_2^*(a))\n\\land\\mathrm{RealizedElementarySymmetricValue}_S(v,x,n,k,D_{P_n},P_n,\\tau_{P_n})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\iota_n)_{2k}^*(u)=v\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chern\\text{-}class\\text{-}universal}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{UniversalChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,k,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land k\\in n+1\\land u\\in H^{2k}(B_n;\\mathbb Z)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists a,x,v\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{TautologicalLineGenerator}_S(a,D_L)\n\\land x\\in H^2(P_n;\\mathbb Z)^n\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall i\\in n\\;x(i)=(\\operatorname{pr}_{n,i})_2^*(a))\n\\land\\mathrm{RealizedElementarySymmetricValue}_S(v,x,n,k,D_{P_n},P_n,\\tau_{P_n})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\iota_n)_{2k}^*(u)=v\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chern\\text{-}class\\text{-}component}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(c_k,k;E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n)\n\\land k\\in n+1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists b,u\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ClassifyingMap}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(b;E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{UniversalChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,k,n)\n\\land c_k=b_{2k}^*(u)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chern\\text{-}class\\text{-}component}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(c_k,k;E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n)\n\\land k\\in n+1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists b,u\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ClassifyingMap}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(b;E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{UniversalChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,k,n)\n\\land c_k=b_{2k}^*(u)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chern\\text{-}class\\text{-}total}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{TotalChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(c;E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\exists C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(C,n+1,\\textstyle\\bigcup_{k\\in n+1}H^{2k}(X;\\mathbb Z))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall k\\in n+1\\;\n\\mathrm{ChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(C(k),k;E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TotalRealizedCohomologyValue}_S(c,C,n,D_X,X,\\tau_X)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chern\\text{-}class\\text{-}total}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{TotalChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(c;E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\exists C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(C,n+1,\\textstyle\\bigcup_{k\\in n+1}H^{2k}(X;\\mathbb Z))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall k\\in n+1\\;\n\\mathrm{ChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(C(k),k;E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TotalRealizedCohomologyValue}_S(c,C,n,D_X,X,\\tau_X)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>分类空间、典范丛及上同调都允许保留已经给定的模型；比较数据把它们与显式内部构造联系起来。</li>\n<li>一次生成元通过典范线丛的球面取值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-1\">\\(-1\\)</span> 归一化；分裂空间上的各根是这一类经各坐标投影的拉回，并非任取一个生成元。</li>\n<li>既有四个元理论谓词名称和参数顺序保留，但其断言现在只含集合、函数、已定义谓词与量词。读者不需要借本节补充定义条件。</li>\n<li>原定义只对存在所需分类映射的丛给出类；这里没有不加条件地断言任意拓扑空间上的所有丛均可由该模型分类。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-complex-vector-bundle","status":"resolved","id":"97bfaddac2f220a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnch