etAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{BundlePullbackIsomorphism}$ 取 [[58-df-bundle-classifying-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cohomology-realization.md","status":"resolved","id":"213ce75a48289483","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{RealizedElementarySymmetricValue}$、$\\mathrm{TotalRealizedCohomologyValue}$ 取 [[58-df-cohomology-realization.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e5fc9ff70d8260ec","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{TautologicalLineGenerator}$ 取 [[58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,c_k,c,b,u\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S","display":false},{"tex":"(E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U:\\omega\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U(n)=\\langle B_n,\\tau_{B_n},\\gamma_n,\\pi_n,\\tau_{\\gamma_n},b_n\\rangle_6","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{UniversalComplexBundleModel}_S(B_n,\\tau_{B_n},\\gamma_n,\\pi_n,\\tau_{\\gamma_n},n,b_n)","display":false},{"tex":"BU(n)=B_n","display":false},{"tex":"L=G_1","display":false},{"tex":"P_n=L^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pr}_{n,i}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{CP}^{\\infty}=L","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_n=b_n\\circ\\mathrm{GrassmannianSplitting}_S(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H:\\mathscr X\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr X","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle Y,\\tau_Y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\langle Y,\\tau_Y\\rangle\\in\\mathscr X\\;\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(\\mathcal H(\\langle Y,\\tau_Y\\rangle),Y,\\tau_Y)","display":false},{"tex":"D_Y=\\mathcal H(\\langle Y,\\tau_Y\\rangle)","display":f